{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57157","headline":"率题六章 第四章叹世人不厌苦任自缠婴 · 傅翕","name":"率题六章 第四章叹世人不厌苦任自缠婴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肯入七宝车，宁归地狱所。\n刀山已伤形，剑树方应处。\n日更痛难当，年年无暂弭。\n流泄三涂中，憔悴玉容毁。\n不听余今训，尔时仙步阻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"傅翕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}